@startuml AI_RSS_01_Architecture_Overview
title AI增强RSS阅读器 - 01 总体架构一眼图

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #334155
skinparam RectangleFontColor #0F172A
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #334155
skinparam ComponentFontColor #0F172A
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #0369A1
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #E0F2FE
skinparam QueueBorderColor #B45309
skinparam QueueBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF7ED
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F97316

actor "用户" as User
cloud "外部RSS源" as RSS #EFF6FF
cloud "AI模型API\nOpenAI / DeepSeek / Ollama" as LLM #F5F3FF

rectangle "A. React 前端" as FE #DCFCE7 {
  component "左侧RSS管理" as FE_Source
  component "中间文章流" as FE_Feed
  component "右侧AI三层面板" as FE_AI
}

rectangle "B. FastAPI 后端" as API #DBEAFE {
  component "RSS Sources API" as API_Source
  component "Articles API" as API_Article
  component "Analysis API" as API_Analysis
  component "抓取/去重服务" as FetchServices
  component "任务投递器" as Dispatcher
}

queue "C. Redis Queue\nCelery Broker" as Redis

rectangle "D. Celery Worker" as Worker #FCE7F3 {
  component "Structured Layer" as Structured
  component "Cognitive Layer" as Cognitive
  component "Decision Layer" as Decision
}

database "E. PostgreSQL" as DB {
  component "rss_sources" as DB_Source
  component "articles" as DB_Article
  component "article_analysis\n三层JSONB结果" as DB_Analysis
  component "reading_state / tags" as DB_State
}

User --> FE : 1. 使用系统
FE --> API : 2. HTTP API
API_Source --> FetchServices : 3. 定时/手动抓取
FetchServices --> RSS : 4. 拉取Feed和正文
FetchServices --> DB : 5. 新文章入库
FetchServices --> Dispatcher : 6. 新文章触发分析
API_Analysis --> Dispatcher : 6b. 手动重分析
Dispatcher --> Redis : 7. 投递异步任务
Redis --> Worker : 8. Celery消费
Worker --> LLM : 9. 三层LLM调用
Worker --> DB : 10. 写入structured/cognitive/decision
API_Article --> DB : 查询文章列表
API_Analysis --> DB : 查询分析状态和结果
FE_AI --> API_Analysis : 展示三层结果

legend right
|= 颜色 |= 职责 |
|<#DCFCE7> 绿色 | 用户界面 |
|<#DBEAFE> 蓝色 | HTTP接口和同步业务 |
|<#FEF3C7> 黄色 | 异步任务边界 |
|<#FCE7F3> 粉色 | AI Worker |
|<#E0F2FE> 浅蓝 | 持久化数据 |

关键原则：
FastAPI 不等待 AI 模型返回；
AI 分析只通过 Redis + Celery 异步执行。
endlegend

@enduml

@startuml AI_RSS_02_Ingestion_To_Queue
title AI增强RSS阅读器 - 02 从RSS抓取到AI任务入队

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  DiamondBorderColor #B45309
  StartColor #16A34A
  EndColor #DC2626
}

start

partition "触发层" #E0F2FE {
  :1. APScheduler 定时触发\n或用户手动 POST /rss-sources/{id}/fetch;
}

partition "抓取层" #DBEAFE {
  :2. 读取 enabled=true 的 rss_sources;
  :3. feedparser 解析 RSS entries;
  :4. trafilatura 提取正文 content;
}

partition "入库层" #DCFCE7 {
  :5. 计算 url_hash / content_hash;
  if (6. 是否重复?) then (重复)
    :跳过文章;
  else (新文章)
    :7. INSERT articles;
    :8. analysis_status = queued;
  endif
}

partition "异步边界" #FEF3C7 {
  :9. analysis_dispatcher.enqueue(article_id);
  :10. Celery delay(analyze_article_task);
  :11. Redis 保存任务;
}

stop

note right
抓取接口返回：
- fetched_count
- inserted_count
- queued_analysis_count

不返回AI分析结果。
end note

@enduml

@startuml AI_RSS_03_AI_Three_Layers
title AI增强RSS阅读器 - 03 三层AI分析输入输出

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #334155
skinparam ComponentFontColor #0F172A
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF7ED
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F97316

database "articles" as Articles #E0F2FE
component "Celery Task\nanalyze_article_task(article_id)" as Task #FEF3C7

component "1. Structured Layer\n\n输入：原文 + 元数据\n输出：structured_result\n\n- topics\n- entities\n- summary\n- key_facts\n- sentiment\n- importance_score\n- confidence" as L1 #DCFCE7

component "2. Cognitive Layer\n\n输入：structured_result + 原文\n输出：cognitive_result\n\n- core_insight\n- drivers\n- trend_type\n- impact_scope\n- bias_risk\n- uncertainties" as L2 #DBEAFE

component "3. Decision Layer\n\n输入：structured + cognitive + user_profile\n输出：decision_result\n\n- attention_required\n- priority_level\n- impact_direction\n- impact_strength\n- recommended_action\n- watchlist_tags" as L3 #FCE7F3

database "article_analysis" as Analysis #E0F2FE {
  component "structured_result JSONB" as SR
  component "cognitive_result JSONB" as CR
  component "decision_result JSONB" as DR
  component "status / task_id / error" as META
}

Articles --> Task : 读取title/source/content
Task --> L1
L1 --> L2 : structured_result
L2 --> L3 : cognitive_result
L3 --> Analysis : UPSERT三层结果

note bottom of Task
状态流转：
queued -> processing -> completed
failed 时保留 error_message，并允许 reanalyze。
end note

@enduml

@startuml AI_RSS_04_Backend_Modules
title AI增强RSS阅读器 - 04 后端模块分层图

top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam PackageBorderColor #334155
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #334155
skinparam ComponentFontColor #0F172A

package "入口层" #DBEAFE {
  component "main.py\nFastAPI app" as Main
  component "scheduler.py\nAPScheduler抓取调度" as Scheduler
}

package "HTTP路由层 routers/" #E0F2FE {
  component "rss.py\n/rss-sources" as RssRouter
  component "articles.py\n/articles" as ArticleRouter
  component "analysis.py\n/analysis" as AnalysisRouter
}

package "业务服务层 services/" #DCFCE7 {
  component "rss_fetcher.py\nRSS解析" as Fetcher
  component "content_extractor.py\n正文提取" as Extractor
  component "deduplication.py\n去重和入库" as Dedup
  component "analysis_dispatcher.py\n只负责投递任务" as Dispatcher
}

package "异步执行层 workers/" #FEF3C7 {
  component "celery_app.py\nRedis连接和队列配置" as CeleryApp
  component "tasks.py\nanalyze_article_task" as Tasks
}

package "AI领域层 ai/" #FCE7F3 {
  component "pipeline.py\n三层编排" as Pipeline
  component "structured_layer.py" as Structured
  component "cognitive_layer.py" as Cognitive
  component "decision_layer.py" as Decision
  component "providers.py\n模型适配" as Providers
  component "prompts/" as Prompts
}

package "数据层" #E0F2FE {
  component "models/\nSQLAlchemy模型" as Models
  component "schemas/\nPydantic DTO" as Schemas
  database "PostgreSQL" as DB
}

Main --> RssRouter
Main --> ArticleRouter
Main --> AnalysisRouter
Scheduler --> Fetcher
RssRouter --> Fetcher
ArticleRouter --> Models
AnalysisRouter --> Dispatcher
Fetcher --> Extractor
Fetcher --> Dedup
Dedup --> Models
Dedup --> Dispatcher
Dispatcher --> Tasks : delay(article_id)
Tasks --> Pipeline
Pipeline --> Structured
Structured --> Cognitive
Cognitive --> Decision
Structured --> Providers
Cognitive --> Providers
Decision --> Providers
Providers --> Prompts
Models --> DB
Schemas ..> RssRouter
Schemas ..> ArticleRouter
Schemas ..> AnalysisRouter
CeleryApp ..> Tasks

legend right
实现约束：
1. routers 不直接调用 LLM
2. services 不执行AI分析，只投递任务
3. workers/tasks.py 是AI异步入口
4. ai/pipeline.py 负责编排三层
endlegend

@enduml

@startuml AI_RSS_05_Data_Model
title AI增强RSS阅读器 - 05 数据模型与三层结果存储

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
  AttributeFontColor #334155
}
hide methods
hide circle

class rss_sources #E0F2FE {
  +id: SERIAL <<PK>>
  --
  name: VARCHAR(255)
  url: TEXT <<UNIQUE>>
  category: VARCHAR(100)
  enabled: BOOLEAN
  fetch_interval_minutes: INT
  last_fetch_time: TIMESTAMP
  created_at: TIMESTAMP
  updated_at: TIMESTAMP
}

class articles #DCFCE7 {
  +id: SERIAL <<PK>>
  --
  source_id: INT <<FK>>
  title: TEXT
  url: TEXT <<UNIQUE>>
  author: VARCHAR(255)
  published_at: TIMESTAMP
  summary: TEXT
  content: TEXT
  url_hash: VARCHAR(64)
  content_hash: VARCHAR(64)
  language: VARCHAR(20)
  analysis_status: VARCHAR(30)
  created_at: TIMESTAMP
}

class article_analysis #FCE7F3 {
  +id: SERIAL <<PK>>
  --
  article_id: INT <<FK, UNIQUE>>
  structured_result: JSONB <<Required>>
  cognitive_result: JSONB <<Required>>
  decision_result: JSONB <<Required>>
  status: VARCHAR(30)
  error_message: TEXT
  model_provider: VARCHAR(50)
  model_name: VARCHAR(100)
  task_id: VARCHAR(255)
  analyzed_at: TIMESTAMP
  updated_at: TIMESTAMP
}

class user_reading_state #FEF3C7 {
  +id: SERIAL <<PK>>
  --
  article_id: INT <<FK>>
  is_read: BOOLEAN
  is_saved: BOOLEAN
  is_archived: BOOLEAN
  read_at: TIMESTAMP
  created_at: TIMESTAMP
}

class tags #F1F5F9 {
  +id: SERIAL <<PK>>
  --
  name: VARCHAR(100) <<UNIQUE>>
}

class article_tags #F1F5F9 {
  +article_id: INT <<PK, FK>>
  +tag_id: INT <<PK, FK>>
}

rss_sources "1" --> "0..*" articles : owns
articles "1" --> "0..1" article_analysis : async AI result
articles "1" --> "0..1" user_reading_state : read/save/archive
articles "1" --> "0..*" article_tags
tags "1" --> "0..*" article_tags

note right of article_analysis
这是AI结果唯一落点：
- structured_result
- cognitive_result
- decision_result

前端右侧三层面板直接读取这三个字段。
end note

@enduml

