@startuml AI_RSS_08_Analysis_Status_State
title AI增强RSS阅读器 - 08 AI分析状态机

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
  StartColor #16A34A
  EndColor #DC2626
}

state queued #FEF3C7
state processing #DBEAFE
state completed #DCFCE7
state failed #FEE2E2

[*] --> queued : 文章入库\n或用户reanalyze
queued --> processing : Celery Worker领取任务
processing --> completed : 三层JSON全部写入
processing --> failed : 任一层失败/JSON无效/模型错误
failed --> queued : 用户重试reanalyze
completed --> queued : 强制重分析force=true
completed --> [*]

note right of completed
completed 必须满足：
structured_result 非空
cognitive_result 非空
decision_result 非空
end note

note right of failed
failed 必须保存：
error_message
task_id
updated_at
end note

@enduml
